  bzip2                                bzip2-1.0.6
  liblzma (XZ Utils)                   0BSD / public domain
  mGBA                                 MPL-2.0
  libusb                               LGPL-2.1-or-later
  libiconv                             LGPL-2.1-or-later
  Bochs disassembler                   LGPL-2.1-or-later
  OpenAL headers                       LGPL-2.0-or-later (LGPL-2.1-or-later.txt
                                       covers the later versions)
  LZO                                  GPL-2.0-or-later
