Qt and FFmpeg are shipped as DLLs, so they can be replaced with other builds
of the same version. The Qt and FFmpeg binaries come from Dolphin's
ext-win-qt and ext-win-ffmpeg repositories.

"GameCube" and "Wii" are trademarks of Nintendo. PixelU-Wii and RetroPixels
are not affiliated with Nintendo or with the Dolphin project. No Nintendo
keys, firmware, BIOS/IPL images or games are included.
